{"strongs": "H6299", "word": "פָּדָה", "translit": "pa.dah", "root": "פגל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "ransom", "definition": "פָּדָה verb ransom (Late Hebrew in derivatives; Phoenician in proper name; Assyrian padû , id. , Arabic ; Ethiopic ; Minaean פדית redeemed or purchased land Mordt Beitr. 23 ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular פָּדָה Lev 27:27 +; suffix פָּֽדְךָ Job 5:20 2 masculine singular פָּדִיתָ Deut 9:26 +, etc.; Imperfect יִפְדֶּה Ps 49:8 +, etc.; Imperative פְּדֵה Ps 25:22 suffix פְּדֵנִי Ps 26:11 + 3 t.; Infinitive absolute פָּדֹה Num 18:15 ; Ps 49:8 construct לִפְדּוֺת 2Sam 7:23 = 1Chr 17:2 Participle active פּוֺדֶה Ps 34:23 suffix פֹּדְךָ Deut 13:6 passive plural construct פְּדוּיֵּי Isa 35:10 ; Isa 51:11 ; Num 3:49 also absolute פְּדוּיִם Num 3:51 ( Qr ; Kt פדים ), construct פְּדוּיֵי v Num 3:46 suffix פְּדוּיָו Num 18:16 (all noun abstract according to Di Kö ii. 1, 138 , see פְּדוּיִם , פִּדְיֹם below); — ransom: 1. for an assessed price Exod 13:13 ; Exod 13:15 ; Exod 34:20 ( J ), Lev 27:27 ; Num 3:46 ; Num 3:48 ; Num 3:49 ; Num 3:51 ; Num 18:15 ; Num 18:16 ; Num 18:17 ( P ). 2. from violence and death 1Sam 14:45 ; Job 6:23 ; Ps 49:8 . 3. God subject (underlying thought of payment): \\ \\ a. from Egypt, with מִן , מִבֵּית עֲבָדִים Deut 7:8 ; Deut 13:6 ; Mic 6:4 מִנִּיצָֿר Ps 78:42 ממצרים 2Sam 7:23 (but strike out פָּדִיתָ Gei Urschr. 288 We Dr and others) = 1Chr 17:21 מִשָּׁם Deut 24:18 absolute Deut 9:26 ; Deut 15:15 ; Deut 21:8 ; Neh 1:10 . \\ \\ b. from exile, Jer 31:11 ; Zech 10:8 יְשֻׁבוּן ׳ פְּדוּיֵּי י Isa 35:10 = Isa 51:11 . \\ \\ c. in general Hos 7:13 מִכֹּל צָרוֺתָיו Ps 25:22 מִכֹּל עֲוֺנוֺתָיו Ps 130:8 . \\ \\ d. with accusative individual Ps 26:11 ; Ps 31:6 ; Ps 44:27 ; Ps 69:19 Abraham Isa 29:22 ׳ פ נפשׁ Ps 34:23 ; Ps 71:23 + מכל צרה 2Sam 4:9 ; 1Kgs 1:29 מֵעֲבֹר בַּשָּׁ֑חַת Job 33:28 מִקְּרָבלִֿי Ps 55:19 מִמָּוֶת Job 5:20 מיד שׁאול Ps 49:16 ; Hos 13:14 מֵעשֶׁק אָדָם Ps 119:134 מִכַּף עָרִיצִים Jer 15:21 . Niph`al Perfect 3 feminine singular (+ Hoph`al Infinitive absolute ) הָפְדֵּה לֹא נִפְדָּ֑תָה Lev 19:20 she hath not been at all ransomed (from bondage); Imperfect יִפָּדֶה Lev 27:29 (from ban); 3 feminine singular צִיּוֺן בְּמִשְׁפָּט תִּפָּדֶ֑ה Isa 1:27 . Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular suffix וְהֶפְדָּהּ Exod 21:8 he shall let her be ransomed . Hiph`il Infinitive absolute see Niph`al", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6524')\">BDB6524</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6299')\">H6299</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6302')\">H6302</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6523')\">BDB6523</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6525')\">BDB6525</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פָּדָה</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>ransom</highlightword> (Late Hebrew in derivatives; Phoenician in proper name; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>padû</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>id.</highlight>, Arabic <placeholder4167/>; Ethiopic <placeholder4168/>; Minaean <bdbheb>פדית</bdbheb> <highlight>redeemed</highlight> or <highlight>purchased land</highlight> Mordt<sup>Beitr. 23</sup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>פָּדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 27:27\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(3,27,27)\">Lev 27:27</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>פָּֽדְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,20)\">Job 5:20</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>פָּדִיתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 9:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,26)\">Deut 9:26</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִפְדֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 49:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,8)\">Ps 49:8</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>פְּדֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 25:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,25,22)\">Ps 25:22</ref> suffix <bdbheb>פְּדֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 26:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,11)\">Ps 26:11</ref> + 3 t.; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>פָּדֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 18:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,15)\">Num 18:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 49:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,8)\">Ps 49:8</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִפְדּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,23)\">2Sam 7:23</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,2)\">1Chr 17:2</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>פּוֺדֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 34:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,23)\">Ps 34:23</ref> suffix <bdbheb>פֹּדְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 13:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,6)\">Deut 13:6</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> plural construct <bdbheb>פְּדוּיֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 35:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,10)\">Isa 35:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 51:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,11)\">Isa 51:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:49\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,49)\">Num 3:49</ref> also absolute <bdbheb>פְּדוּיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 3:51\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,51)\">Num 3:51</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>פדים</bdbheb>), construct <bdbheb>פְּדוּיֵי</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 3:46\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,46)\">Num 3:46</ref> suffix <bdbheb>פְּדוּיָו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 18:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,16)\">Num 18:16</ref> (all noun abstract according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 1, 138</sup></lookup>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>פְּדוּיִם</reflink></bdbheb>, <bdbheb>פִּדְיֹם</bdbheb> below); — <highlight>ransom:</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> for an assessed price <ref ref=\"Exod 13:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,13)\">Exod 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 13:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,15)\">Exod 13:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 34:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,20)\">Exod 34:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lev 27:27\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(3,27,27)\">Lev 27:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:46\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,46)\">Num 3:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:48\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,48)\">Num 3:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:49\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,49)\">Num 3:49</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:51\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,51)\">Num 3:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,15)\">Num 18:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,16)\">Num 18:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,17)\">Num 18:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> from violence and death <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:45\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,45)\">1Sam 14:45</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 6:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,6,23)\">Job 6:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 49:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,8)\">Ps 49:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> God subject (underlying thought of payment): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> from Egypt, with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מִבֵּית עֲבָדִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 7:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,8)\">Deut 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 13:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,6)\">Deut 13:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 6:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,6,4)\">Mic 6:4</ref> <bdbheb>מִנִּיצָֿר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:42\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"42\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"42\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,42)\">Ps 78:42</ref> <bdbheb>ממצרים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:23\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,23)\">2Sam 7:23</ref> (but strike out <bdbheb>פָּדִיתָ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gei')\">Gei<sup>Urschr. 288</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and others) = <ref ref=\"1Chr 17:21\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(13,17,21)\">1Chr 17:21</ref> <bdbheb>מִשָּׁם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,18)\">Deut 24:18</ref> absolute <ref ref=\"Deut 9:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,26)\">Deut 9:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 15:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,15)\">Deut 15:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 21:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,21,8)\">Deut 21:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,10)\">Neh 1:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> from exile, <ref ref=\"Jer 31:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,11)\">Jer 31:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 10:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,10,8)\">Zech 10:8</ref> <bdbheb>יְשֻׁבוּן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּדוּיֵּי י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 35:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,35,10)\">Isa 35:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 51:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,11)\">Isa 51:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> in general <ref ref=\"Hos 7:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,13)\">Hos 7:13</ref> <bdbheb>מִכֹּל צָרוֺתָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 25:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,25,22)\">Ps 25:22</ref> <bdbheb>מִכֹּל עֲוֺנוֺתָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 130:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"130\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"130\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,130,8)\">Ps 130:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> with accusative individual <ref ref=\"Ps 26:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,26,11)\">Ps 26:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,6)\">Ps 31:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 44:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,27)\">Ps 44:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 69:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,19)\">Ps 69:19</ref> Abraham <ref ref=\"Isa 29:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,22)\">Isa 29:22</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>נפשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 34:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,23)\">Ps 34:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 71:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,23)\">Ps 71:23</ref> + <bdbheb>מכל צרה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 4:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,4,9)\">2Sam 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,29)\">1Kgs 1:29</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעֲבֹר בַּשָּׁ֑חַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:28\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,28)\">Job 33:28</ref> <bdbheb>מִקְּרָבלִֿי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,19)\">Ps 55:19</ref> <bdbheb>מִמָּוֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 5:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,20)\">Job 5:20</ref> <bdbheb>מיד שׁאול</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 49:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,16)\">Ps 49:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 13:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,14)\">Hos 13:14</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעשֶׁק אָדָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:134\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"134\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"134\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,134)\">Ps 119:134</ref> <bdbheb>מִכַּף עָרִיצִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 15:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,15,21)\">Jer 15:21</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular (+ <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight>) <bdbheb>הָפְדֵּה לֹא נִפְדָּ֑תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\